e si muove è morto"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"While on the move, Denis's patrol is ambushed. Finding himself alone, Denis steps on a mine and is left stranded in the middle of a barren desert. If he moves, Denis risks death: psychologically shattered, he must try to physically resist a situation from which he may be helpless alone."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Après avoir survécu à une attaque éclair, le sergent Denis Quillard pose le pied sur une mine russe à double détente. Seul rescapé de sa patrouille, coincé au milieu du désert afghan, il doit faire face à cette situation et affronter ses doutes comme ses peurs. L’ennemi se rapproche. Il a quelques heures pour s’en sortir. Le compte à rebours a commencé.","tagline":"S'il bouge, il meurt"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ueXwrepA2N4O0WBJFi5zaNrfKJg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92mS1hdJbvHO2pV8lrIOEE7jxTw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":255905,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ueXwrepA2N4O0WBJFi5zaNrfKJg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ueXwrepA2N4O0WBJFi5zaNrfKJg.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ueXwrepA2N4O0WBJFi5zaNrfKJg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ueXwrepA2N4O0WBJFi5zaNrfKJg.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pIQo5ICIcy7WWn1E8uNtTbtrWz1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pIQo5ICIcy7WWn1E8uNtTbtrWz1.jpg","language":"fr","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pIQo